    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16374" root="رقع" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَقْعٌ</span></b>  (TA) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّقْعُ</span> (K, TA) <i>The seventh
heaven.</i> (K, TA.) So, accord. to some, in a
verse of Umeiyeh Ibn-Abi-s-Salt, [where others
read <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِرْقِعَ</span> instead of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَقْعًا</span>,] cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدِرٌ</span>. (TA.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّقِيعُ</span>,]

